#: ../../mcp.md:1
msgid "MCP"
msgstr "MCP"

#: ../../mcp.md:3
msgid ""
"minacode can connect to [Model Context "
"Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io) servers and call their tools "
"through its `MCP` tool. Servers can be **remote** (HTTP) or **local** "
"(stdio), and <span class=\"marker\">nothing about a server reaches the "
"model until you connect it</span>."
msgstr ""
"minacode 可以连接 [Model Context Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io) "
"server，并通过 `MCP` 工具调用其工具。Server "
"可以是**远程**（HTTP）或**本地**（stdio）；在主动连接之前，<span class=\"marker\">该 server "
"的任何信息都不会进入模型 context</span>。"

#: ../../mcp.md:8
msgid "Configuring servers"
msgstr "配置 server"

#: ../../mcp.md:10
msgid "Each server is an `[mcp.<name>]` block."
msgstr "每个 server 对应一个 `[mcp.<name>]` 配置块。"

#: ../../mcp.md:12
msgid "Remote (HTTP)"
msgstr "远程（HTTP）"

#: ../../mcp.md:22
msgid "Local (stdio)"
msgstr "本地（stdio）"

#: ../../mcp.md:32
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Key"
msgstr "配置项"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Applies to"
msgstr "适用范围"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`url`"
msgstr "`url`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "remote"
msgstr "远程"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Server endpoint (mutually exclusive with `command`)"
msgstr "Server endpoint（不能与 `command` 同时设置）"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`command`, `args`"
msgstr "`command`, `args`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "local"
msgstr "本地"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Program and arguments to launch"
msgstr "要启动的程序和参数"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`env`"
msgstr "`env`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Extra environment variables for the subprocess"
msgstr "传给子进程的额外环境变量"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`auth = \"oauth\"`"
msgstr "`auth = \"oauth\"`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Authenticate via interactive OAuth"
msgstr "通过交互式 OAuth 认证"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`bearer_token_env_var`"
msgstr "`bearer_token_env_var`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Send `Authorization: Bearer <env var>`"
msgstr "发送 `Authorization: Bearer <env var>`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`env_http_headers`"
msgstr "`env_http_headers`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Map of HTTP header → env var holding its value"
msgstr "HTTP header 到保存其值的环境变量映射"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`auto_connect`"
msgstr "`auto_connect`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "both"
msgstr "两者"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Connect at startup instead of on demand (default `false`)"
msgstr "启动时连接，而不是按需连接（默认 `false`）"

#: ../../mcp.md:44
msgid "Connecting"
msgstr "连接"

#: ../../mcp.md:46
msgid ""
"Servers are <span class=\"marker\"><strong>manual by "
"default</strong></span> — they stay inactive, and cost nothing, until you"
" connect them. Set `auto_connect = true` for servers you always want. "
"Ways to connect:"
msgstr ""
"Server <span "
"class=\"marker\"><strong>默认手动连接</strong></span>：连接前保持未激活，也不会占用 "
"token。对始终需要的 server，可设置 `auto_connect = true`。连接方式包括："

#: ../../mcp.md:50
msgid "**`/mcp`** — open the interactive manager and toggle a server on or off."
msgstr "**`/mcp`** — 打开交互式管理器，切换 server 的连接状态。"

#: ../../mcp.md:52
msgid ""
"MCP server manager listing all configured servers and their connection "
"status"
msgstr "MCP server 管理器列出全部已配置 server 及其连接状态"

#: ../../mcp.md:57
msgid "The /mcp interactive server manager."
msgstr "`/mcp` 交互式 server 管理器。"

#: ../../mcp.md:59
msgid ""
"**`@server`** in a message — connect on demand. The connection remains "
"active until you disconnect it."
msgstr "在消息中输入 **`@server`** — 按需连接。连接会保持，直到主动断开。"

#: ../../mcp.md:62
msgid "Using @server mention to connect an MCP server on demand"
msgstr "使用 `@server` 引用按需连接 MCP server"

#: ../../mcp.md:67
msgid "Connecting a server on demand with an @-mention."
msgstr "通过 `@` 引用按需连接 server。"

#: ../../mcp.md:69
msgid ""
"**`/mcp connect <server> [server ...]`** / **`/mcp disconnect <server>`**"
" — terminal fallbacks."
msgstr ""
"**`/mcp connect <server> [server ...]`** / **`/mcp disconnect <server>`**"
" — 终端命令形式。"

#: ../../mcp.md:71
msgid "**`/mcp tools [server]`** — list the tools of connected servers."
msgstr "**`/mcp tools [server]`** — 列出已连接 server 的工具。"

#: ../../mcp.md:73
msgid ""
"Connecting several servers in one command runs them concurrently; "
"interactive OAuth browser flows are serialized so they do not interfere "
"with each other."
msgstr "一条命令连接多个 server 时会并发执行；交互式 OAuth 浏览器流程会串行进行，避免互相干扰。"

#: ../../mcp.md:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Once a server is connected, minacode can use its tools like any other. "
"Tools the server marks read-only run without a prompt; anything that may "
"change state asks for {ref}`confirmation <built-in-guardrails>` first."
msgstr ""
"连接后，minacode 可以像使用其他工具一样使用该 server 的工具。Server "
"标记为只读的工具无需确认即可运行；可能改变状态的操作会先请求{ref}`确认 <built-in-guardrails>`。"

#: ../../mcp.md:80
msgid "Scripting tool calls"
msgstr "脚本化工具调用"

#: ../../mcp.md:82
msgid ""
"When the agent expects several <span class=\"marker\">same-shape MCP "
"calls</span> — the same tool with a handful of different arguments — it "
"can write one Python script instead of emitting each call separately, and"
" only what the script prints returns to the conversation. See "
"[ToolScript](tools.md#toolscript), which covers scripting built-in tools "
"as well."
msgstr ""
"当 agent 预期要发出若干次<span class=\"marker\">形状相同的 MCP 调用</span>——同一工具搭配少量不同参数——它可以写一个 Python "
"脚本,而不是逐个发出调用,只有脚本 print 的内容回到对话。参见 [ToolScript](tools.md#toolscript),它也覆盖内置工具的脚本化。"

#: ../../mcp.md:87
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

#: ../../mcp.md:89
msgid ""
"**Bearer token** — set `bearer_token_env_var` (or a custom header via "
"`env_http_headers`)."
msgstr ""
"**Bearer token** — 设置 `bearer_token_env_var`，或通过 `env_http_headers` 设置自定义"
" header。"

#: ../../mcp.md:90
msgid ""
"**OAuth** — set `auth = \"oauth\"`. Connecting runs the authorization "
"flow; disconnecting clears the saved login."
msgstr "**OAuth** — 设置 `auth = \"oauth\"`。连接时执行授权流程；断开连接会清除已保存的登录信息。"

#: ../../mcp.md:93
msgid "Trust"
msgstr "信任边界"

#: ../../mcp.md:95
msgid ""
"Local (stdio) servers run programs on your machine, and remote servers "
"receive whatever the agent sends them. Only connect servers you trust."
msgstr "本地（stdio）server 会在你的机器上运行程序，远程 server 会收到 agent 发给它的内容。只连接可信的 server。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`call(name, args, format=\"text\")` — `name`"
#~ " must be `\"MCP\"`; built-in tools"
#~ " answer `not scriptable yet`. "
#~ "`format=\"text\"` returns the rendered result;"
#~ " `format=\"json\"` returns a parsed dict."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`call(name, args, format=\"text\")` — `name`"
#~ " 必须是 `\"MCP\"`;内置工具会回答 `not scriptable "
#~ "yet`。`format=\"text\"` 返回渲染后的结果;`format=\"json\"` 返回解析后的"
#~ " dict。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`format=\"json\"` prefers the server's "
#~ "declared `structuredContent`. Two errors are"
#~ " possible:"
#~ msgstr "`format=\"json\"` 优先取 server 声明的 `structuredContent`。可能有两种错误:"

#~ msgid "Describing shapes in bulk"
#~ msgstr "批量描述形状"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`ToolScript(action=\"describe\", tools=[...])` batch-"
#~ "reports each tool's call shape and "
#~ "a json gate. A list entry is "
#~ "either a built-in tool name like"
#~ " `\"Read\"` or an MCP tool as "
#~ "`\"server.tool\"`:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`ToolScript(action=\"describe\", tools=[...])` "
#~ "批量报告每个工具的调用形状与 json gate。列表条目可以是内置工具名(如 `\"Read\"`)或"
#~ " `\"server.tool\"` 形式的 MCP 工具:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`json: yes` — the server declared "
#~ "an `outputSchema`, so `format=\"json\"` below"
#~ " can rely on it."
#~ msgstr "`json: yes` — server 声明了 `outputSchema`,因此下面的 `format=\"json\"` 可以依赖它。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`json: unknown` — no declared schema;"
#~ " `format=\"json\"` will try to parse "
#~ "the returned text and may fail."
#~ msgstr "`json: unknown` — 未声明 schema;`format=\"json\"` 会尝试解析返回的文本,可能失败。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`json: no` — built-in tools: "
#~ "scriptable with `format=\"text\"`, but no "
#~ "structured return yet."
#~ msgstr "`json: no` — 内置工具:可用 `format=\"text\"` 脚本化,但暂无结构化返回。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The MCP rendering matches "
#~ "`MCP(action=\"describe\")` with the gate line"
#~ " added; built-in entries are compact"
#~ " one-liners with their parameter "
#~ "essentials. Either way, a shape learned"
#~ " here is what a scripted call "
#~ "will actually receive."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "MCP 条目的渲染与 `MCP(action=\"describe\")` 一致,只是多了一行 "
#~ "gate;内置条目是带参数要点的紧凑单行。无论哪种,在这里学到的形状就是脚本化调用实际会收到的。"

#~ msgid "Running a script"
#~ msgstr "运行脚本"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`ToolScript(action=\"call\", code=\"...\")` runs the"
#~ " code as Python. Inside it, `call()`"
#~ " invokes a tool — built-in or"
#~ " MCP:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`ToolScript(action=\"call\", code=\"...\")` 以 Python"
#~ " 运行该代码。在其中,`call()` 调用一个工具——内置或 MCP:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`call(name, args, format=\"text\")` — `name`"
#~ " is a built-in tool like "
#~ "`\"Read\"`, `\"Bash\"`, or `\"Edit\"`, or "
#~ "`\"MCP\"` for a server tool. `Delegate`,"
#~ " `Job`, and `ToolScript` itself cannot "
#~ "be nested. `format=\"text\"` returns the "
#~ "rendered result; MCP calls may use "
#~ "`format=\"json\"` for a parsed dict, "
#~ "while built-ins refuse it until "
#~ "they gain structured results (`<name> "
#~ "does not support format=\"json\"`)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`call(name, args, format=\"text\")` — `name`"
#~ " 是内置工具名,如 `\"Read\"`、`\"Bash\"` 或 `\"Edit\"`,也可以是"
#~ " `\"MCP\"` 表示 server 工具。`Delegate`、`Job` 与"
#~ " `ToolScript` 自身不可嵌套。`format=\"text\"` 返回渲染后的结果;MCP "
#~ "调用可用 `format=\"json\"` 拿到解析后的 "
#~ "dict,内置工具在获得结构化返回前会拒绝(`<name> does not support "
#~ "format=\"json\"`)。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Nested calls go through the <span "
#~ "class=\"marker\">same confirmation, live logging,"
#~ " and `tr.N` retention as top-level"
#~ " calls</span>, and they never add "
#~ "extra tool messages — the agent "
#~ "still sees exactly one result per "
#~ "call it emitted."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "嵌套调用走与顶层调用<span class=\"marker\">相同的确认、实时日志与 `tr.N` "
#~ "保留</span>,并且绝不会产生额外的 tool message——agent "
#~ "仍然恰好为它发出的每个调用看到一条结果。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The result envelope lists the nested "
#~ "`tr.N` keys, so a shortened output "
#~ "can still be recalled."
#~ msgstr "结果信封会列出嵌套的 `tr.N` key,因此被截短的输出仍可被 Recall。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Refusing a nested call aborts the "
#~ "script; the rest of the outer "
#~ "batch continues."
#~ msgstr "拒绝一次嵌套调用会中止脚本;外层批次的其余调用继续执行。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A script that fails returns with a"
#~ " traceback (source lines included) so "
#~ "the agent can correct itself."
#~ msgstr "失败的脚本会带着 traceback(含出错行源码)返回,以便 agent 自行修正。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Pure script execution is budgeted at "
#~ "about 60 seconds, excluding time spent"
#~ " inside nested calls."
#~ msgstr "纯脚本执行约有 60 秒的预算,不包括嵌套调用内部耗时。"

#~ msgid "The json gate in practice"
#~ msgstr "json gate 的实际行为"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Built-in tools report `json: no` "
#~ "and take `format=\"text\"` only: "
#~ "`format=\"json\"` refuses with `<name> does"
#~ " not support format=\"json\"`. For MCP "
#~ "calls, `format=\"json\"` prefers the server's"
#~ " declared `structuredContent`. Two errors "
#~ "are possible:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "内置工具标 `json: no`,只接受 "
#~ "`format=\"text\"`:`format=\"json\"` 会以 `<name> does"
#~ " not support format=\"json\"` 拒绝。对 MCP "
#~ "调用,`format=\"json\"` 优先取 server 声明的 "
#~ "`structuredContent`。可能有两种错误:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The tool declared an `outputSchema` but"
#~ " the call returned no `structuredContent`"
#~ " — reported as `server declared "
#~ "outputSchema but no structuredContent`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "工具声明了 `outputSchema`,但调用没有返回 `structuredContent` —"
#~ " 报告为 `server declared outputSchema but "
#~ "no structuredContent`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "No schema was declared and the "
#~ "returned text is not JSON — "
#~ "reported as `MCP returned text that "
#~ "is not JSON`."
#~ msgstr "未声明 schema 且返回的文本不是 JSON — 报告为 `MCP returned text that is not JSON`。"

#~ msgid "Safety"
#~ msgstr "安全"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The script is <span class=\"marker\">not "
#~ "sandboxed</span>: it runs with the same"
#~ " privileges as `Bash`. `ToolScript` asks"
#~ " for confirmation on every "
#~ "`action=\"call\"` and the prompt shows "
#~ "the opening lines of the script, "
#~ "syntax-highlighted; `--yolo` skips that "
#~ "confirmation exactly as it does for "
#~ "`Bash`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "脚本<span class=\"marker\">不是沙箱</span>:它与 `Bash` "
#~ "拥有相同权限。`ToolScript` 对每次 `action=\"call\"` "
#~ "都会请求确认,提示会展示脚本开头若干行,并带语法高亮;`--yolo` 会像跳过 `Bash` "
#~ "一样跳过该确认。"

#~ msgid "Reading the script"
#~ msgstr "查看脚本"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The log shows a bounded excerpt of"
#~ " the script, not all of it —"
#~ " a long script would bury everything"
#~ " it then goes on to do. The "
#~ "whole body is one keypress away:"
#~ msgstr "日志只展示脚本的有限摘录,而不是全文 —— 长脚本会把它随后做的一切都淹没。完整脚本只差一次按键:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`v` at the confirmation prompt** opens"
#~ " a read-only, scrolling viewer with"
#~ " the complete script, numbered and "
#~ "highlighted. `Esc`/`q` returns to the "
#~ "prompt; nothing is approved by viewing."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**在确认提示处按 `v`** 会打开只读、可滚动的查看器,展示带行号与高亮的完整脚本。`Esc`/`q` "
#~ "回到提示;查看本身不会批准任何东西。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`Ctrl-O` afterwards** lists recent `Bash`"
#~ " and `ToolScript` calls; selecting a "
#~ "script opens the same viewer, with "
#~ "the result it returned below the "
#~ "source — the printed output, or "
#~ "the whole traceback when the script "
#~ "failed. This is how a script is"
#~ " read under `--yolo`, where no prompt"
#~ " ever stops to offer `v`. A "
#~ "very large result is bounded there "
#~ "(head and tail, long lines clipped) "
#~ "and the header says when it was."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**事后按 `Ctrl-O`** 会列出最近的 `Bash` 与 "
#~ "`ToolScript` 调用;选中一个脚本即可打开同一个查看器,并在源码下方显示它返回的结果——print "
#~ "的输出,或者脚本失败时的完整 traceback。在 `--yolo` "
#~ "下就是这样读脚本的,因为那里没有任何提示会停下来提供 "
#~ "`v`。超大的结果在那里会被限制(保留头尾、截断超长行),发生时头部会写明。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Line numbers in the viewer match "
#~ "the ones in a failed script's "
#~ "traceback (`File \"<toolscript>\", line N`)."
#~ msgstr "查看器中的行号与脚本失败时 traceback 里的行号一致(`File \"<toolscript>\", line N`)。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Calls the script makes are logged "
#~ "indented under it, on a `│` rail"
#~ " that runs unbroken from the script"
#~ " through every call it made — "
#~ "including whatever each of those calls"
#~ " logged below itself, a diff or "
#~ "a command's output — down to the"
#~ " result line. The batch therefore "
#~ "reads as work the script did "
#~ "rather than as calls the model "
#~ "made itself, and the closing line "
#~ "reports how many nested calls ran "
#~ "and the first lines of what the"
#~ " script printed."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "脚本发起的调用会缩进记录在它下面,并落在一条 `│` 竖线上:这条线从脚本一路不断开地穿过它发起的每一次调用 "
#~ "——包括每次调用自己在下方记录的内容,比如一段 diff "
#~ "或一条命令的输出——直到结果行为止。于是这一批读起来是脚本做的事,而不是模型自己发起的调用;收尾行会报告嵌套调用的数量,以及脚本打印内容的开头几行。"

